{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>SonicPro 可把 iPhone 變成可記錄證據的手持式聲級計，適合需要現場量度噪音、頻譜與暴露劑量的用戶；原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-218.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>實時聲級與頻譜分析</h2>\n<p>提供即時 dBA、dBC、dBZ、Leq、峰值與 10 秒趨勢，支援 Fast、Slow、Impulse 時間加權及 A、C、Z 頻率加權；另有 72 頻段 FFT、頻譜圖、八度分析、94 dB 校正、噪音劑量、證據相機、錄音分析與 CSV、m4a 匯出。內置麥克風非認證儀器，30 至 85 dB 誤差約 2 至 3 dB，適合篩查記錄，不宜作法律或合規依據。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-258-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-259-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-260-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-261-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-262-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-263-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：SonicPro: Sound Level Meter</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/sonicpro-sound-level-meter/id6823545377?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T23:04:20.226183+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T22:54:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T02:37:30.719583+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T22:57:48.803297+00:00","content_hash":"dc8424901ec28903d12a67ff54a048af0947c660011fa271d9f9e15976a887b7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}